 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【热门新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a2849e19f951native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真来！皇马官方：1.5亿欧报价阿尔瓦雷斯！马竞以解约金为由拒绝</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100329373459.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100329373459.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100329373459.jpg"> </div><p>皇马官方宣布，俱乐部已经以1.5亿欧元价格向马竞报价阿尔瓦雷斯，但是马竞以解约条款为由拒绝了这一报价。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a2857bdc97d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞官方回应皇马：我们一点不感谢报价，你们比巴萨还能逗我们笑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.82" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100214595190.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.82" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.82" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100214595190.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100214595190.jpg"> </div><p>在转发皇马声明配上五个笑哭表情后，马竞官方账号再次在各平台统一发文回应皇马“1.5亿报价阿尔瓦雷斯被马竞拒绝”的声明。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a2850c1956d4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅要来了！皇马官方：和阿韦洛亚达协议，他不再担任一线队主帅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100144292002.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100144292002_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100144292002_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">皇马官方宣布，与主帅阿韦洛亚达成协议，他将结束作为一线队主帅的任期。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a288014ee7e6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">本菲卡官方：穆里尼奥离任！皇马支付1500万解约金穆帅已同意邀请</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a094d49f1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a094d49f1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a094d49f1.jpg"> </div><p>本菲卡官方宣布，穆里尼奥已经对皇马（支付1500万欧元解约金）的邀请表达了接受；他将离任并执教皇马。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a2882bb2c40dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">接替穆帅！本菲卡官方：马尔科·席尔瓦担任球队新帅，签约2+1年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100518184117.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100518184117.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100518184117.jpg"> </div><p>本菲卡在官宣穆里尼奥加盟皇马后火速官宣了穆帅的继任者。前富勒姆主帅马尔科·席尔瓦担任球队新帅。双方签约2+1年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a28687dceb17native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">倒计时2天！世界杯夺冠赔率更新：西班牙领跑，葡萄牙反超阿根廷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a162c0294784_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a162c0294784_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a162c0294784_720.jpg"> </div><p>距2026年世界杯揭幕还剩2天。目前，各参赛队的世界杯前热身赛即将陆续结束，相关机构也更新了最新的世界杯夺冠赔率，西班牙仍是夺冠最大热门。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a284aba57e50native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真相大白！皇马的1.5亿欧元目标正是阿尔瓦雷斯，但马竞直接拒绝</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260605/202606050537238453.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260605/202606050537238453_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260605/202606050537238453_720.jpg"> </div><p>弗洛伦蒂诺在此前采访中提到了“1.5亿报价一名中前场‘银河战舰级别’超巨”的承诺。但外界此前普遍认为弗洛伦蒂诺的目标是奥利塞，不过根据皇马的公告，这个目标被确认为阿尔瓦雷斯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a285b05a7900native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最“疯”官号！马竞官方号两周内因阿尔瓦雷斯先嘲巴萨，再讽皇马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.86" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100204599239.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.86" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.86" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100204599239_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100204599239_720.jpg"> </div><p>北京时间5月30日凌晨，针对巴萨和阿尔瓦雷斯的传闻，马竞官方也曾连续发文反击，而且也是在全语言平台账号上都有相关发布。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a28746cbf7benative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">龙赛罗：小蜘蛛不值1.5亿，皇马就是故意抬高身价给巴萨制造阻碍</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d710a702dc7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d710a702dc7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d710a702dc7.jpg"> </div><p>皇马官方宣布，俱乐部已经以1.5亿欧元价格向马竞报价阿尔瓦雷斯，但是马竞以解约条款为由拒绝了这一报价。对此，《阿斯报》主编龙赛罗撰文发表看法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a285012334b4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃杜：皇马的声明可谓双赢！老佛爷兑现承诺，马竞抬价+表明立场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg"> </div><p>今日凌晨皇马官方宣布，向马竞提出1.5亿欧报价阿尔瓦雷斯，但马竞方面进行了拒绝。对此，阿根廷跟队记者埃杜发文解读。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a285b550a7a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：皇马1.5亿报价阿尔瓦雷斯遭拒，巴萨计划不变仍看好小蜘蛛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d0486b707.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d0486b707.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d0486b707.jpg"> </div><p>世体报道，皇家马德里以1.5亿欧元报价朱利安·阿尔瓦雷斯，但被马德里竞技拒绝。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a28628a5f2e1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">1.5亿到此为止！TA：皇马不会再为小蜘蛛加价；马竞认为报价不诚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251001/68dcd7b633cbe.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG