18318413.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a14218318413.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a14218318413.jpg"> </div><p>据记者Ben Jacobs的报道，阿尔瓦雷斯合同中的5亿欧元解约金条款比外界看起来的情况要复杂得多。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a284d81220fcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘世界杯！廷伯：我心碎不已；实在难以接受伤病夺走了这次机会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100132517850.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100132517850_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100132517850_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">昨日荷兰官方消息，廷伯因腹股沟伤势未康复，将无法随队参加世界杯；此外荷兰队补招海特勒伊达入替。廷伯更新个人社媒，发文表达对自己无缘世界杯的遗憾。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a283b0602c67native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：哈弗茨未能达到塔帅当初的期望，阿森纳必须决定是否续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b0db198444.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b0db198444.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b0db198444.jpg"> </div><p>夺得英超冠军但在欧冠决赛中惜败巴黎圣日耳曼后，阿森纳将会继续补强阵容以圆梦欧冠。但是，枪手需要解决阵中多名球星的未来问题，哈弗茨就是其中之一。《伦敦标准晚报》透露了最新消息。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a283d63a30bfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">尤斯特喊话弗洛伦蒂诺：法庭上见！巴萨有获胜的把握，会追究到底</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100026097878_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100026097878_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260610/202606100026097878_720.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨临时主席尤斯特于当地时间本周二出席了会员大会，他发表了开幕致辞，回顾了巴萨的情况并回应了弗洛伦蒂诺此前发布会中就内格雷拉事件发表的言论。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a284cc04cc03native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：皇马向UEFA提供500页文件要求剥夺冠军，巴萨感到难以置信</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250118/678bb7358f983.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250118/678bb7358f983.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250118/678bb7358f983.jpg"> </div><p>据《阿斯报》报道，对于皇马向欧足联提交500页文件，要求剥夺巴萨过去所拿到的冠军，红蓝军团方面认为这令人难以置信。在巴萨看来，欧足联无权剥夺自己未组织赛事的冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-10/6a28547f8fbbfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：穆里尼奥中场引援首选M费，西汉姆联要价不低于9000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2717a504bd7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2717a504bd7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2717a504bd7.jpg"> </div><p>据西班牙《每日体育报》报道，穆里尼奥带着改革球队的决心以及决策权回到皇马，他希望签下6名新援。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-